      "message": "How does this relate to `schemas/firmware.json` and how `phosphor-bmc-code-mgmt` matches component images to firmware devices?\n\nIs the existing mechanism there unusable for `pldmd` ?",
      "revId": "cbf6de5b7bb26dac6fbdd386086dc8b9b99eb9cd",
